    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**4 Killenure Court, Knockavilla, Co. Tipperary**\r\n\r\nMaher Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market this excellent three-bedroom semi-detached property located in the popular residential development of Killenure Court, Knockavilla. Presented in turnkey condition throughout, this property offers a wonderful opportunity for first-time buyers, families or those looking for a comfortable home in a peaceful rural setting.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is bright, well presented and ready for immediate occupation, with the property having been carefully maintained by its current owners. A particular feature is the excellent energy efficiency, with the property benefiting from **PV solar panels and a BER rating of B**, helping to reduce energy costs while providing a more sustainable home.\r\n\r\nThe property also benefits from both **front and rear access**, while the private rear garden has been fully paved, providing a low-maintenance outdoor space ideal for relaxing, entertaining or enjoying the summer months.\r\n\r\nKnockavilla is a charming rural village situated approximately 10km northwest of Cashel and just 2.5km from Dundrum. The village has a strong community atmosphere and benefits from a primary school, church and community facilities, with the highly regarded Knockavilla National School located in the village. The surrounding area offers beautiful countryside and easy access to the larger towns of Cashel, Tipperary and Thurles, making this an ideal location for those seeking the tranquillity of village living without being too far from essential amenities.\r\n\r\n**4 Killenure Court is a fantastic turnkey home in a desirable rural setting, offering modern energy efficiency, low-maintenance gardens and excellent access to local amenities. Early viewing is highly recommended.**\r\n\r\nFor any further inquiries, feel free to reach out to our Sales Team via email or phone. Please note that we have not tested any appliances, fixtures, fittings, or services, and interested parties are encouraged to carry out their own investigations regarding their functionality. All measurements are approximate, and photographs are provided for guidance only. Viewing strictly by appointment only through Maher Auctioneers, 062 61211."
      },
